+#
+# Pokemon Red initializes the bedroom map and coordinates while Professor
+# Oak's introduction is still on screen.  Those ordinary state fields are
+# therefore not proof that the player can act.  V11 keeps a one-way latch that
+# is set only after all of the supported-ROM input-ready signals are true and a
+# directional input actually changes Red's coordinates in the bedroom.
